# Animal pickers & Death records

When changing animal lists, bulk activities, or death/culling flows, follow this pattern.

## Death records (bulk cull / death)

- Activity name: **Death records** (EN) / **Rekodi za vifo** (SW). Cull = **kuchinja** in Swahili (not “uteuzi”).
- Hub: `/mortality` with **New death** → `/mortality/bulk` — select animals → **Continue** → shared death details (cause, disposal, date).
- Single animal: Death tab **Record Death / Culling** (`/animals/[id]`) must use the same cause picker (system list + **add new** custom cause).
- Custom causes live in ranch `settings.customDeathCauses` (string[]); persist as `DeathCause.OTHER` + `causeDetail` = cause name. `CULLING` / kuchinja sets `isCulling`.

## Animal data fetching UI (all pickers & lists)

Prefer shared pieces under `src/components/animals/`:

- **Eartag colour**: show `EartagBadge`; filter with colour swatches (`TagColorFilter`) using resolved colour (animal → year → camp → ranch default).
- **Customize columns**: show/hide columns (localStorage prefs). Keep eartag + checkbox always on for selection UIs.
- **Filters**: search by eartag, camp/location, sex/type pills, status, breed; ear-tag colour is first-class.
- Keep Manyika branding (not Cattlytics green). Prefer simple panels over heavy modals when enough.

New bulk activity pickers (sales, treatment, move, etc.) should reuse this picker pattern rather than inventing a thinner checkbox list.
